{
  "name": "Toyota GR86 / Subaru BRZ 2022-2026 (ZN8/ZD8) - DCM or ASC connector, 500k",
  "bitrate": 500000,
  "_help": [
    "On these cars the OBD-II port only answers OBD requests; the broadcast data below is on the",
    "DCM connector behind the glovebox (GR86, non-US BRZ) or the ASC connector (US BRZ).",
    "Decodes from github.com/timurrrr/ft86 (can_bus/gen2.md) and RaceChronoDiyBleDevice.",
    "Byte signals: start (byte 0 = first), length, endian, signed. Bit signals: bit + bits, read",
    "little-endian like RaceChrono's bitsToUIntLe(raw, bit, bits). value = raw * scale + offset,",
    "then clamped to min/max. rawMax drops 'not available' values. \"disabled\": true switches one off.",
    "\"nodes\" groups ids by module for the boot-time CAN node check."
  ],
  "signals": [
    {
      "channel": "rpm",
      "id": "0x40",
      "bit": 16,
      "bits": 14,
      "note": "100 Hz. bitsToUIntLe(raw, 16, 14)"
    },
    {
      "channel": "throttle",
      "id": "0x40",
      "start": 4,
      "length": 1,
      "scale": 0.392157,
      "note": "Accelerator pedal, E / 2.55"
    },
    {
      "channel": "speed",
      "id": "0x139",
      "bit": 16,
      "bits": 13,
      "scale": 0.015694,
      "note": "50 Hz, km/h. Check against GPS if you run non-stock tyre sizes"
    },
    {
      "channel": "brake",
      "id": "0x139",
      "start": 5,
      "length": 1,
      "scale": 1.428571,
      "max": 100,
      "note": "Brake pressure as %, min(F / 0.7, 100)"
    },
    {
      "channel": "steering",
      "id": "0x138",
      "start": 2,
      "length": 2,
      "endian": "little",
      "signed": true,
      "scale": -0.1,
      "note": "Degrees, positive = left"
    },
    {
      "channel": "yaw_rate",
      "id": "0x138",
      "start": 4,
      "length": 2,
      "endian": "little",
      "signed": true,
      "scale": -0.2725,
      "note": "deg/s, positive = turning left"
    },
    {
      "channel": "gear",
      "id": "0x241",
      "bit": 35,
      "bits": 3,
      "note": "6MT: 0 = N, 1-6. Delete this entry on the 6AT (gear is then estimated from rpm/speed)"
    },
    {
      "channel": "clutch",
      "id": "0x241",
      "start": 5,
      "length": 1,
      "shift": 7,
      "mask": 1,
      "scale": 100,
      "note": "100 = pedal down"
    },
    {
      "channel": "oil_temp",
      "id": "0x345",
      "start": 3,
      "length": 1,
      "offset": -40,
      "note": "D - 40"
    },
    {
      "channel": "coolant",
      "id": "0x345",
      "start": 4,
      "length": 1,
      "offset": -40,
      "note": "E - 40"
    },
    {
      "channel": "intake_temp",
      "id": "0x390",
      "start": 4,
      "length": 1,
      "scale": 0.5,
      "offset": -40,
      "note": "Air temperature, E / 2 - 40"
    },
    {
      "channel": "fuel",
      "id": "0x393",
      "bit": 32,
      "bits": 10,
      "scale": -0.097752,
      "offset": 100,
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "note": "Unfiltered, work in progress upstream"
    },
    {
      "channel": "tire_fl",
      "id": "0x6E2",
      "start": 3,
      "length": 1,
      "shift": 1,
      "rawMax": 126,
      "scale": 6.8948,
      "note": "US cars (cluster in psi): (D >> 1) psi -> kPa. For bar clusters use scale 10"
    },
    {
      "channel": "tire_fr",
      "id": "0x6E2",
      "start": 4,
      "length": 1,
      "shift": 1,
      "rawMax": 126,
      "scale": 6.8948
    },
    {
      "channel": "tire_rl",
      "id": "0x6E2",
      "start": 5,
      "length": 1,
      "shift": 1,
      "rawMax": 126,
      "scale": 6.8948
    },
    {
      "channel": "tire_rr",
      "id": "0x6E2",
      "start": 6,
      "length": 1,
      "shift": 1,
      "rawMax": 126,
      "scale": 6.8948
    },
    {
      "channel": "lat_g",
      "id": "0x13B",
      "start": 6,
      "length": 1,
      "signed": true,
      "scale": 0.2,
      "disabled": true,
      "note": "Coarse/noisy upstream; the phone's sensors are smoother. Enable to use the car's"
    },
    {
      "channel": "lon_g",
      "id": "0x13B",
      "start": 7,
      "length": 1,
      "signed": true,
      "scale": -0.1,
      "disabled": true
    },
    {
      "channel": "wheel_fl",
      "id": "0x13A",
      "bit": 12,
      "bits": 13,
      "scale": 0.015694,
      "note": "DCM connector only (not on the ASC bus)"
    },
    {
      "channel": "wheel_fr",
      "id": "0x13A",
      "bit": 25,
      "bits": 13,
      "scale": 0.015694
    },
    {
      "channel": "wheel_rl",
      "id": "0x13A",
      "bit": 38,
      "bits": 13,
      "scale": 0.015694
    },
    {
      "channel": "wheel_rr",
      "id": "0x13A",
      "bit": 51,
      "bits": 13,
      "scale": 0.015694
    },
    {
      "channel": "brake_light",
      "id": "0x139",
      "start": 4,
      "length": 1,
      "shift": 2,
      "mask": 1,
      "note": "Brake light switch, E & 0x4"
    },
    {
      "channel": "neutral",
      "id": "0x40",
      "start": 3,
      "length": 1,
      "shift": 7,
      "mask": 1,
      "note": "1 in neutral, MT and AT"
    },
    {
      "channel": "reverse",
      "id": "0x228",
      "start": 2,
      "length": 1,
      "mask": 1,
      "note": "1 in reverse, MT and AT"
    }
  ],
  "nodes": {
    "ECM": [
      "0x40",
      "0x41",
      "0x345",
      "0x390",
      "0x393"
    ],
    "ABS·VDC": [
      "0x139",
      "0x13A",
      "0x13B",
      "0x13C"
    ],
    "STEERING": [
      "0x138"
    ],
    "TCM": [
      "0x241",
      "0x48"
    ],
    "BODY": [
      "0x228",
      "0x6E1"
    ],
    "METER": [
      "0x6E2"
    ]
  }
}